function 'Common.TI.CARD.PD' = ```
		/// Returns the measure value for the previous day, 
		/// used in KPI cards for daily comparison.
		(
		    // Measure value to shift by one day
		    _value: EXPR
		) =>
		CALCULATE(
		    _value,
		    DATEADD( D_Calendar[Calendar Date], -1, DAY )
		)
		```
